From 3f688a91905f967d854ffbcef107497543971bc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: devbotbo <7118.eth@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 20:24:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Wire the blind-relay endpoints beside the default response
 path

POST /relay/request builds the registered minimal request with the
client's public JWK in client_metadata.jwks and the address-bound nonce;
POST /response/:id stores the JWE for a relay session before any parsing
or decryption and answers with the optional redirect_uri/response_code
shape; GET /relay/status/:id polls; GET /relay/response/:id hands the
JWE to the pickup-token holder once (410 afterwards, RELAY_PICKUP_ONCE
to make it repeatable). Non-relay sessions are untouched.
---
 verifier-service/src/handlers.rs | 260 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 verifier-service/src/main.rs     |  38 +++--
 2 files changed, 286 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

